2. Insert Script inside "Astral", paste init.server.lua
3. Insert ModuleScript "config" inside "Astral", paste config.lua
4. Insert Folder "modules" inside "Astral"
5. Inside "modules" create 12 ModuleScripts with names above
6. Paste code into each ModuleScript
7. Enable HTTP: Game Settings -> Security -> Allow HTTP Requests
8. Fill Telegram token + Discord webhook in MessageScript
9. Add "LastAttacker" in your combat system for ReachDetect
